---
pageKey: groups
---
{#- While the call runs this page is the call: the registry title leads ("Přihlášky"), the call
    section follows and the selected groups sit under it. Once the call closes call.njk renders
    nothing, the "Soubory" sub-heading drops away and the page is the groups list again. -#}
{%- set callShown = edition.ageMin and edition.status == 'upcoming' -%}
<section class="wrap section">
  <h1>{{ registry.title | t(lang) }} {{ edition.year }}</h1>
</section>
{% include "partials/call.njk" %}
<section class="wrap section">
  {%- if callShown %}
  <h2>{{ db.copy.groups.heading | t(lang) }}</h2>
  {%- endif %}
  {% include "partials/groups-list.njk" %}
</section>
